  "description": "Desperate for answers during his entrance exams, Seojun discoverd a strange ability to pick the right solution from the given options. He thought he'd hit the lottery and would lead a happy stress-free college life with a bright future ahead. But one day, the Goddess of Destruction, Angolmois appeared and everything went downhill. The world can't end just yet! Will Seojun be able to protect the Earth and himself from doom?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=771717), [Naver Series](https://m.series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6179163)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thailand](https://www.webtoons.com/th/fantasy/apocalypsexchoice/list?title_no=4197&page=4)",
